34ce1761","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"なるほど、あるある","ts":"1633585240.227500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CMC4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06948db0-5b90-485e-9c3f-0ea33c136f10","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"キャッシュバグだったようなので、キャッシュキーを追加して直しました。","ts":"1633585097.227200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uCBA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe215879-7a26-4443-93b8-ab7f10bb6162","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"どこかで silent が使われていて echomsg ‘markdown’ がでなくなってたっぽいです。（おそらく telescope サイドで行われている？）","ts":"1633585081.226800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tFST6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"86415d6f-35f8-4ca1-a6df-ed9bcf4e3eaf","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"なんでだろう…。","ts":"1633584978.226300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mEDQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b053d2a-ce0c-463b-914b-c5eda68d6e05","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"これは非同期関係ないはずです。そもそも `echomsg 'markdown'` が実行されてないので。。。","ts":"1633582802.226000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"80cxZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b73b968-81b7-441d-9848-eb3be98a22d6","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"非同期だから調査が難しくなる","ts":"1633581917.225500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l4+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8acec26f-cf31-4340-a2ba-8e86da8e7425","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"こういう問題かなりキツい","ts":"1633581908.225200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"td1t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff1667f8-7182-4648-93ed-791f54196360","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/hrsh7th/nvim-cmp/issues/274|https://github.com/hrsh7th/nvim-cmp/issues/274\u003e","ts":"1633581900.224800","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/hrsh7th/nvim-cmp/issues/274|#274 Bug: nvim-cmp doesn't auto select when chaining methods\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/hrsh7th/nvim-cmp/issues/274|#274 Bug: nvim-cmp doesn't auto select when chaining methods\u003e","text":"For example given this line:\n\n```\nobject.get().some_property\n                          ^ cursor trying to auto complete here\n\n```\n\nWhen I press tab to select the entry I want, then continue typing, nvim-cmp deletes everything that I've typed such that it's now just:\n\n```\nobject.get().\n\n```\n\nBut it would work just fine when auto completing the first `get()`. In order to solve this I have to use `ctrl-space`.\n\nI'm using nvim 0.5.1 Window. So far I've only tested it with tsserver.","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"needs-info","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"8","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/hrsh7th/nvim-cmp|hrsh7th/nvim-cmp\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1633414904}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QSD"}]}]
